OL,3,GNEWSAHovis workers' strike could
OL,4,Adisrupt bread deliveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FBread deliveries are set to be
OL,7,Fdisrupted as Hovis lorry drivers plan
OL,8,Fto strike over a pay dispute.
OL,10,FAbout 60 Unite the Union members based
OL,11,Fat the depot in Avonmouth near Bristol
OL,12,Fare due to indefinitely strike from 24
OL,13,FSeptember after staff were offered a 3%
OL,14,Fpay rise.
OL,16,FRepresentatives at Unite the Union said
OL,17,Fthe offer is a pay cut as inflation
OL,18,Fsits at 3.4% and shops across the West
OL,19,Fof England are likely to see a
OL,20,Freduction in Hovis products.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
