OL,3,GNEWSAHovis workers' strike could
OL,4,Adisrupt bread deliveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Hovis Bakeries said
OL,7,Fthe offer on the table was "fair and
OL,8,Fresponsible", adding that they do not
OL,9,Fanticipate any "significant or lasting
OL,10,Fshortages" in supply.
